<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms buy 50,000T of Argentine corn.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms buy 50,000T of Argentine corn.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean feed mill companies, including Miwon Co Ltd, Woo Sung Feed Mill Co Ltd and Purina Korea bought 50,000 tonnes of Argentine corn at $154.40 per tonne c&amp;f on Tuesday, traders said.  </p>
<p>Traders said Toepfer won the contract. Arrival is set for next July 15 at the western port city of Inchon.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
